OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,6,Fsees a return to much brighter skies
OL,7,Fwith lighter winds. A spell of wet and
OL,8,Fwindy weather arrives later on
OL,9,FSaturday, with the brighter, showery
OL,10,Fweather back for Sunday.
